# Ship text files with LF regardless of the checkout platform. SKILL.md is
# //go:embed-ed and installed verbatim into ~/.claude/skills, and a CRLF
# checkout on Windows changes the embedded bytes — which broke the
# frontmatter test and would make the embedded/marketplace copies differ
# from what ships on other platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
